{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测首次出现NFS AUTH_SYS以root UID访问。对应需求：数据收集。官方：First Time Seen NFS AUTH_SYS Root UID Access。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["logs-network_traffic.nfs*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】首次出现NFS AUTH_SYS以root UID访问","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n首次出现NFS AUTH_SYS以root UID访问\n\n### 为何重要\n收集邮箱、屏幕或敏感文件\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1213/","https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1039/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"35ef761a-7136-4cb9-a32d-4e7abddb3bac","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 数据收集","来源: 默认","对应需求: 数据收集"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"new_terms","query":"data_stream.dataset:network_traffic.nfs and\nnetwork_traffic.nfs.rpc.cred.uid:0 and\nnetwork_traffic.nfs.rpc.auth_flavor:unix and\nsource.ip:* and destination.ip:*\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1039","name":"Data from Network Shared Drive","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1039/"},{"id":"T1213","name":"Data from Information Repositories","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1213/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0009","name":"Collection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0009/"}}],"new_terms_fields":["source.ip","destination.ip"],"history_window_start":"now-5d","interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","i